%% Associations persistantes
User "*" -- "*" Role : possede
Role "*" -- "*" Permission : autorise
User "1" -- "0..*" UserPreference : preferences
Machine "1" *-- "0..*" Sensor : contient
Sensor "1" -- "0..*" SensorData : produit
Machine "1" -- "0..*" EnvironmentalTelemetry : mesure
Machine "1" -- "0..*" MachineTechnicianAssignment : affectations
MachineTechnicianAssignment "*" --> "1" User : technicien
MachineTechnicianAssignment "*" --> "1" User : affectePar
Part "1" -- "0..*" InventoryUsage : consommations
Part "1" -- "0..*" ReorderRequest : demandes
Part "1" -- "0..*" StockOrder : commandes
Supplier "1" -- "0..*" StockOrder : fournit
StockOrder "1" -- "1" ReorderRequest : realise
MachineFailureReport "1" *-- "0..*" MachineFailureReportPart : piecesRequises
MaintenanceReport "1" *-- "0..*" ReportPart : pieces
MaintenanceReport "1" *-- "0..*" ChecklistItem : checklist
SupportTicket "1" *-- "0..*" PortalMessage : messages

%% References metier entre modules
Machine ..> Maintenance : machineId
Machine ..> Task : machineId
Machine ..> PredictionRecord : machineId
Machine ..> PredictionHistory : machineId
Machine ..> Alert : machineId
Machine ..> SensorTelemetry : machineId
Machine ..> MachineEvent : machineId
Machine ..> MachineSimulationState : machineId
Machine ..> MaintenanceRecommendation : machineId
Maintenance ..> Task : maintenanceId
Maintenance ..> PartReservation : maintenanceId
MaintenanceRecommendation ..> Maintenance : resultingMaintenanceId
Task ..> MaintenanceReport : taskId
Task ..> ExpenseReport : maintenanceTaskId
Part ..> PartReservation : partId
Part ..> MachineFailureReportPart : partId
PredictionRecord ..> Notification : predictionRecordId
Machine ..> Notification : machineId
Machine ..> ExpenseReport : machineId
Machine ..> MaintenanceReport : machineId
Machine ..> CustomerMachineLink : machineId
Machine ..> Warranty : machineId
Machine ..> Invoice : machineId
Machine ..> SupportTicket : machineId
User ..> Invoice : customerUserId
User ..> SupportTicket : customerUserId
User ..> CustomerMachineLink : userId
SupportTicket ..> PortalMessage : ticketId
Attachment ..> NlpImageAnalysis : attachmentId
Machine ..> NlpAnalysis : machineId
Machine ..> NlpImageAnalysis : machineId

